WEBVTT

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.020
anayechukua kozi 40,

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.868
atalipa dola 1,000 kwa mwaka,

00:09:02.868 --> 00:09:05.564
Dola 4,000 kukamilisha digrii,

00:09:05.564 --> 00:09:09.030
na kwa wale hawawezi kumudu hata hii,

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:11.667
tunawapa udhamini aina mbali mbali.

00:09:11.667 --> 00:09:14.972
Ni dhamira yetu kuwa hakuna
atakayeachwa nyuma

00:09:14.972 --> 00:09:17.100
kwa sababu za kifedha.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.563
Kwa wanafunzi 5,000 mwaka wa 2016,

00:09:20.563 --> 00:09:25.260
muundo huu ni endelevu kifedha.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:29.857
Miaka mitano iliyopita, yalikuwa maono.

00:09:29.857 --> 00:09:32.714
Leo, ni halisi.